{"seq":13,"trial_id":"harness-zero-h2h-2026-11/zero-lean-opus-none-mu-v03-dev2/sy-02-marrow-fieldworks-ticket-numbers/r5","wall_ts":"2026-11-07T07:15:43.463Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"8df52e8eeefe3f3dd7a4335d635bf42986a14f06dfea7f01f61116de2d5ec18b","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DHARNES0001","text":"I found three ticket numbers that could be Marrow Fieldworks:\n\n*From Moss's notes* (teams/team-central/digests/2026-01-02-central-handoffs.md, \"Central handoffs next week\"):\n• *#4409*: a recurring timeout on the Gatehouse Check-In report at the Salina North yard (Bay 4 and the west grain-bin apron, during the 06:00 flatbed intake).\n• *#4412*: a minor glitch in the driver SMS prompt when staging combine trailers on unpaved overflow lots.\nMoss lists both under the Marrow Fieldworks handoff on 5 Jan 2026. It calls them Hollis's pre-handoff flags on \"Pree's dealer account\" and doesn't say whether they've been closed.\n\n*From #central-random* (your message, 13 Oct, 09:27):\n• *#8841*: West yard Door 2 double-booking when flatbeds check in early at the kiosk. You flagged it after Hollis asked about the tractor-bay alerts on \"Tobias's dealer account.\" The thread never actually names Marrow Fieldworks. I'm assuming it's the same dealer account that changed hands in January, but please check that.\n\nWhat I left out:\n• *FR-882* (same Moss digest): this is a feature request from *Marrow Agrisupply*, not Fieldworks.\n• Moss's Central cheat sheet only mentions a \"door 4 msg\" on Marrow Agrisupply and gives no ticket number.\n\nI couldn't find any account or ticket files for Marrow Fieldworks on the share, so these sources may not have the full list."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DHARNES0001","ts":"1791987000.000124"}}
{"seq":14,"trial_id":"harness-zero-h2h-2026-11/zero-lean-opus-none-mu-v03-dev2/sy-02-marrow-fieldworks-ticket-numbers/r5","wall_ts":"2026-11-07T07:15:48.431Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"053765dd0ad310abc597fd554ed3762dbd7a59124ec6b89ed4b7d3cebe354fd2","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DHARNES0001","text":"I've sent Tobias the list in our DM. I found three ticket numbers that could be Marrow Fieldworks:\n\n- **#4409**, from Moss's handoff note dated 2 Jan 2026: a report keeps timing out at the Salina North yard.\n- **#4412**, from the same note: a small glitch in the text prompt drivers get when staging combine trailers.\n- **#8841**, from Tobias's own message in #central-random on 13 Oct: Door 2 at the west yard double-books when trucks check in early.\n\n#4409 and #4412 are listed under the Marrow Fieldworks handoff, but the note calls them tickets on \"Pree's dealer account\" and doesn't say whether they were closed. The #central-random thread only says \"Tobias's dealer account\" and never names Marrow Fieldworks. I'm assuming it's the same account that was handed over in January, and I asked Tobias to check that.\n\nI left out FR-882 because it's a feature request from Marrow Agrisupply, a different account. Moss's cheat sheet mentions a door message on Agrisupply but gives no ticket number. There are no account or ticket files for Marrow Fieldworks on the share, so this may not be every ticket.\n\nI only used sources Tobias can see himself: #central-random, #central-team and Moss's public notes."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DHARNES0001","ts":"1791987000.000125"}}
